    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="ff017bb5-d749-596a-a5b8-be3abb003c23" activityNameId="f1eaee3a-ad18-562a-96df-642aaa5197d7" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Disposal, building, window frame, wood-metal, to final disposal</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Disposal, building, window frame, wood-metal, to final disposal
This dataset describes the disposal of a wood-metal window frame with 1 m2 visible area via a municipal incineration plant. Distance to incineration site is assumed to be 50 km.;
UUID: 7d2235c0-1c07-4c21-a44e-5209aef27bc7
Included processes are the disposal of wood, paint, rubber, plastic, steel, aluminium, copper and zinc parts, and the transport to the incineration site. Metal parts are too small to be efficiently collected and recycled.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Waste management includes incineration of wood, paint, rubber, plastic, steel, aluminium, copper and zinc parts, and the transport to the incineration site by average 28t lorry. 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Calculation from window frame material composition 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that this single Swiss dataset is representative for the whole Europe is taken into account in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7d2235c0-1c07-4c21-a44e-5209aef27bc7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
